OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FThe
OL,6,Fweather looks generally dry and
OL,7,Fsettled through the period. Variable
OL,8,Fcloud with bright or sunny spells
OL,9,Flikely and temperatures will rise
OL,10,Fagain, so feeling hotter, with winds
OL,11,Fremaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
